<section class="about-section" id="about">

    <div class="container about-grid">

        <div class="about-content">

            <p class="section-label">ABOUT PURVI ENTERPRISES</p>

            <h2>
                10 Years of Experience.
                <br />
                Built on Quality & Trust.
            </h2>

            <p>
                Purvi Enterprises is a trusted name in construction,
                interior and furnishing solutions based in Kharghar,
                Navi Mumbai.
            </p>

            <p>
                With more than <strong>10 years of experience</strong>,
                we undertake residential, commercial and interior projects
                with a strong focus on quality workmanship, professional
                execution and customer satisfaction.
            </p>

            <p>
                From civil and electrical work to POP and customized
                furniture, we provide complete solutions under one roof.
            </p>

            <div class="about-services">

                <div>
                    <strong>Residential</strong>
                    <span>Projects</span>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <strong>Commercial</strong>
                    <span>Projects</span>
                </div>

                <div>
                    <strong>Interior</strong>
                    <span>Solutions</span>
                </div>

            </div>

        </div>


        <div class="experience-box">

            <span>10+</span>

            <p>
                YEARS OF
                <br />
                EXPERIENCE
            </p>

